11. login is LoginApi, filter email from accounts table, hash passwrod to compare with accounts table 

three steps for account authrization
I. post user and password
II. read user and md5 hashed password to compare
III. return jwt token to client as login credential, jwt token (HS256 algorithm) has user_id, expired time, client use it during the available time, client use "Bearer $jwt_token" as "Authorization" in Headers for authrization
when user post requests with this token, server use jwt decode this token with algorithm, to get user_id, check if user_id in accounts table

